        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Works: “Money Trees”, Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80, “Worst Behavior”\n- Roles: American hip hop recording artist, American rapper, Canadian rapper, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 in 2011 as an independent album exclusively through the iTunes Store.\n- Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City in 2012 as his second studio album.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by Kendrick Lamar taken from his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- “Money Trees” features Jay Rock, who is Kendrick Lamar’s label-mate.\n- DJ Dahi is known for producing Drake’s “Worst Behavior” and Kendrick Lamar’s critically acclaimed album cut “Money Trees”.",
